:: Lake Mason Swim Together
<<effects>>
<<npc Mason>><<person1>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>>
<<pass 30>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You ask Mason if you can swim laps across the lake together.
    <br><br>
    Mason's face brightens with an open, genuine smile. "I'd love that! Swimming with someone who shares the passion makes every lap better. Let's see how long you can keep up with me."
    <br><br>
    Side by side, you cut through the crystalline, deep waters of the lake. Mason's sculpted, naked body glides through the cool water with effortless power and poise, <<his>> rhythmic kicks leaving trails of silver bubbles.
    <br><br>
    Together you dive down through the sun-dappled thermocline, matching strokes and surfacing in tandem to draw in the crisp forest air. Mason turns to you, eyes sparkling with admiration and joy: "That was exhilarating! You have fantastic stamina."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你提议和梅森一起在湖中并肩畅游。
    <br><br>
    梅森脸上绽放出由衷而灿烂的笑容。“好啊！能和同样热爱游泳的人一起畅游，感觉完全不一样。来看看你能跟上我多久吧！”
    <br><br>
    你们并肩破开碧绿清澈的湖水，向前划去。梅森那具线条饱满健美的赤裸躯体在清凉的湖水中舒展自如，每一次充满爆发力的蹬腿都在身后划出一串银白色的气泡。
    <br><br>
    你们一同潜入被阳光斜斜穿透的温跃层深处，默契地同步换气与划臂，又同时破开水面大口呼吸森林清新的空气。梅森转头看向你，眼眸里泛着毫不掩饰的赞赏与欢欣：“太痛快了！你的耐力真让我刮目相看。”
